        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「突然联系你，失礼了。/n　我是Dai Star盛典上负责评审你们的人之一。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "！哦……没想到居然能收到一位被称作Dai Star的名演员/n亲自打来的电话，真是荣幸。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "2252",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那么，找我有什么事？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「……我就直说了。/n　有一项演剧奖赛，我非常希望你们Eden参加。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「那是由我参与评审与运营的赛事。/n　应该不是什么坏事……你觉得呢？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "谁知道呢。/n我演戏又不是为了追求什么荣誉。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「那我换个说法。我给你们一个挑战的机会。/n　……一个向演剧界证明，你们的舞台才是至高之作的机会。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「还是说……你们已经退出这场挑战了？/n　如果是这样，那可真遗憾。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈，怎么可能……好吧，就让你激一次。/n这个邀请，我接了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1840",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 2,
      "BgmFileName": "205",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "世界演剧联盟辛苦你们了。/n千寿成为了最为闪耀的Dai Star。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "沃尔芙这边虽说没能让银河座获选为最闪耀的剧团，/n但我听世界演剧联盟的评审说，银河座的舞台评价很高。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历、拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "谢谢您。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200240",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……好了，寒暄就到这里，说正事吧。/n今天叫你们两个来，是为了谈谈银河座今后的事情。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……我想你们应该已经知道了。/n接下来，我们将正式成立一个独立于银河座之外的新剧团。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "与银河并肩而立的新剧团，名字叫……「星云」。/n而它的座长……任命拉莫娜·沃尔芙担任。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……是！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我已经做好觉悟了……在那个舞台上看见的世界，/n　我要率领大家……成为银河之中闪耀于天顶的星。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200290",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "银河由千寿历带领，星云由拉莫娜·沃尔芙带领。/n希望两位座长彼此协作，共同编织我们剧团的未来。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "暦",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "明白了。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "2253",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……以上。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "暦",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（最近，周围的局势每天都在令人目不暇接地变化。/n　若是从前，重视传统的银河座根本不需要任何变化。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "暦",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（但现在……这样的变化，一定是值得欣喜的。/n　新的容身之处诞生了，也有了让更多星辰闪耀的空间。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050120039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "暦",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（银河正在以好的方式改变形态……。伴随着演员们的演技，/n　不断扩展开来……持续闪耀。即使面对时间的流逝，也绝不会败下阵来。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501200360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
